@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C3E50
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C3E50
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #ECF0F1
}

title Sincronización Reactiva del Tablero (Flujo del frontend)

actor "Jugador" as U
participant "Game.tsx (React)" as Game
participant "WebSocketManager" as WS
participant "Backend (Spring)" as API
participant "matchUtil (Logic)" as Util

== Establecimiento de Conexión ==

U -> Game: Carga pantalla /game/:matchId
activate Game

Game -> Game: useFetchState (Initial Snapshot)
note right: Carga inicial vía REST de:\nMatch, Players, Tiles y Salmons

Game -> WS: initConnection(jwt)
WS -> API: Connect (STOMP over SockJS)
API --> WS: Connected

Game -> WS: addSubscription("/topic/match/update/...")
Game -> WS: addSubscription("/topic/movingSalmon/...")
Game -> WS: addSubscription("/topic/tiles/place/...")

== Reacción a Eventos (Tiempo Real) ==

API -> WS: Mensaje: { salmon, myTile, toTravel }
WS -> Game: Callback: movingSalmon

Game -> Util: updateGridWithMovement(oldGrid, ...)
activate Util
Util -> Util: coordToIndex(x, y)
Util -> Util: Inmutabilidad: Spread Operator [...]
Util --> Game: newGrid (Inmune a mutaciones)
deactivate Util

Game -> Game: setGrid(newGrid)
note right: React detecta cambio de estado\ny dispara re-renderizado parcial

Game -> U: Actualiza posición del Salmón (Animado)

== Gestión de Desconexión ==

U -> Game: Abandona Partida / Cierra Pestaña
Game -> WS: deactivate()
note right: Cleanup de suscripciones\npara evitar memory leaks.
deactivate Game

@enduml
